aaEquiv is the order isomorphism from the elements of A to the elements of the separated sum Aⁿ + Aⁿ, given by toAA with inverse fromAA. The composites are the identity by fromAA_toAA and toAA_fromAA. One element lies below another exactly when its image does, by matching the universe and the two tagged tuples on one side with the sum master and the two injections on the other, through toAA_mem_inj₀ and toAA_mem_inj₁.
